<tr nodeId="80ba5b066e5a41189d2e10838a8b07e9">
<td colwidth="[124]" nodeId="271a499e4cff493da428e4001aafc8f6">
<p nodeId="343c4e5d33014435922ab63f4826e139"><span font-size="14">修改作用域</span></p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[465]" nodeId="5b23c83ef5304df9a085d45dc8f2abc2">
<p nodeId="20421acbe56a45d6bc2cb66c2fed3c9f"><span font-size="14">提交修改时，系统会判断本次修改是否变更了作用域，并给予用户二次弹窗确认是否修改。</span></p>
<ul nodeId="51ed835d838843dd80e3e3c12711f256">
<li nodeId="b3a1769d3e1c4fea9f48327ffdd6460b"><span font-size="14">作用域有新增部分：产生的新监控单元，从修改提交那刻开始计数</span></li>
<li nodeId="adca01df1cc040bf959ae2f148545336"><span font-size="14">作用域有删减部分：对应的监控单元清空计数</span></li>
<li nodeId="8b2c184ccf5e49a39881fb562f74e921"><span font-size="14">未增减的那部分作用域：不影响，涉及的老监控单元继续计数</span></li>
</ul>
</td>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="95751d06f52d4ecb884418087bf3d101">
<td colwidth="[124]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="rgb(255, 255, 255)" nodeId="56544a9729ba466bb9fb2b4a21ac5dd3">
<p nodeId="909ba1dc8bb64e10a4354f18632c944c"><span font-size="14">作用时间</span></p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[465]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="rgb(255, 255, 255)" nodeId="ac8ac7e108e14d8085daa1d4aedc8886">
<p nodeId="ae8962cd7c3a4e7e9ed0a6a8d6e33c77"><span font-size="14">不影响</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="b87a0578fc1c45418f39f82f52c86e1a">
<td colwidth="[124]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="rgb(255, 255, 255)" nodeId="e717f16007154ce1b59539da8031e650">
<p nodeId="99bcc523e1f744a6b86475a6c3d0319a"><span font-size="14">熔断规则</span></p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[465]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="rgb(255, 255, 255)" nodeId="dee1c30e0a924721b4fa45295192bac8">
<p nodeId="673ab4563d3b4f0c9a1868696bae461d"><span font-size="14">提交修改时，系统会判断本次修改是否变更了熔断规则，并给予用户二次弹窗确认是否修改。</span></p>
<ul nodeId="9f6cf46062de4562b9b7343e429a3ea3">
<li nodeId="a6819b6a888f4b0bbf8907784534e5d2"><span font-size="14">新增熔断规则（含子规则）：产生的新监控单元，从修改提交那刻开始计数</span></li>
<li nodeId="2f76625c9ab74ea282258268b52ed50c"><span font-size="14">删除熔断规则（含子规则）：对应的监控单元清空计数</span></li>
<li nodeId="1f0384a4d3a14967bc1425588268ddab"><span font-size="14">未动的熔断规则（含子规则）：涉及的老监控单元继续计数</span></li>
<li nodeId="c9d743e9766f4caabd47f194fd040a3c">
<p nodeId="702ecc8b1edb42b499803d9cdf3843d7"><span font-size="14">编辑内容的熔断规则（含子规则）：</span></p>
<ul nodeId="9c17df42371341348bde4c99b2904d47">
<li nodeId="6abbfb2bbb494bc68b563a37b08ed581"><span font-size="14">时间周期、计算函数、对比关系、阈值：</span><span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)"><span font-size="14">修改不影响，涉及的老监控单元继续计数</span></span></li>
<li nodeId="f27e129bcd04493dad069263ac4eee20"><span font-size="14">指标、去重维度：</span><span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)"><span font-size="14">不允许修改</span></span></li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
</td>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="cfa7cb4b9b9f4c10980a5977bf885d23">
<td colwidth="[124]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="rgb(255, 255, 255)" nodeId="c7a06d5b319d4d5e9b41a33ce47bb903">
<p nodeId="49ced23b6aee4cda8479c4da39474b1a"><span font-size="14">熔断动作</span></p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[465]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="rgb(255, 255, 255)" nodeId="385efe1607fc4ca09149716fde80e719">
<p nodeId="3e6ef82e36c5415f99f1041ea2b7cf6e"><span font-size="14">不影响</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="6b43f7946c9f45888ed3ccb8839a65cf">
<td colspan="3" colwidth="[216,124,465]" nodeId="0a6a02487ca0428583884879d9f5ede0">
<p nodeId="d5a636a667824c6a95b6e1839e2e0c33"><span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)"><span font-size="14">熔断复制：复制熔断，相当于用被复制对象的配置 新建了一条熔断配置，因此也是重新开始计数。</span></span></p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
<h1 nodeId="da3301caf35b4453a3a00f1f94810d1f">4.特殊说明</h1>
<table borderColor="#cccccc" responsive="false" nodeId="a9664ca7df53430088522e5765d8133b">
<tr nodeId="a04b6008916c40a5a7fb6676d6df43ef">
<th colwidth="[162]" nodeId="9576a5ab21f84a60873a48100eae6b13">
<p nodeId="d7dc4765d7c9479db3a273cbab6651d3"><span font-size="14">项目</span></p>
</th>
<th colwidth="[885]" nodeId="e4a5b9cbe6294fe68848bbab6987d95b">
<p nodeId="f1418384cb3a49d4bdec052e785abfee"><span font-size="14">说明</span></p>
</th>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="8587a9b6e4304ccd94a8607b604983fa">
<td colwidth="[162]" nodeId="e06549c569f54147b9f85a679a2b160a">
<p nodeId="2ab4dd258d47496e81e7902850d98798"><span font-size="14">屏蔽期覆盖不到的部分</span></p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[885]" nodeId="c566dddeb5db4f979f02e0db189c71a3">
<p nodeId="fc2aa13ec0984de9b64e6f2a940cbfcd"><span color="rgb(38, 38, 38)"><span font-size="14">目前，用户在未更改熔断配置的情况下，去zeus场景配置里【新增】了生效（灰度）的规则而产生的新监控单元，熔断的屏蔽期还无法覆盖到。</span></span><span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)"><span font-size="14">对于这部分新增的监控单元，将没有屏蔽期作用</span></span><span color="rgb(38, 38, 38)"><span font-size="14">，即新增后，一旦满足熔断规则便会立刻报出，请知晓。</span></span></p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
